cXR0Mlh5Vzd2WXgwajFpc003V2hGQ1FQRmh2YU9QdHg4alNEQWY2YzJFN3lReW1UMFRn?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"艾伯維 (AbbVie) 報告 2026 年第三季財務業績"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":9},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":4},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-20","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1551152/000155115226000008/abbv-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"AbbVie or \"the company\" refer to AbbVie Inc., or AbbVie Inc. and its consolidated subsidiaries, as the context requires. AbbVie is a global, diversified research-based biopharmaceutical company positioned for success with a comprehensive product portfolio that has leadership positions across immunology, neuroscience, oncology and aesthetics. AbbVie uses its expertise, dedicated people and unique approach to innovation to develop and market advanced therapies that address some of the world's most complex and serious diseases. AbbVie was incorporated in Delaware on April 10, 2012. On January 1, 2013, AbbVie became an independent, publicly-traded company as a result of the distribution by Abbott Laboratories (Abbott) of 100% of the outstanding common stock of AbbVie to Abbott's shareholders.","zh":"艾伯維（AbbVie）或「本公司」指艾伯維公司（AbbVie Inc.）或艾伯維公司（AbbVie Inc.）及其合併子公司（視上下文而定）。艾伯維是一家全球性、多元化的研究型生物製藥公司，憑藉全面的產品組合取得成功，在免疫學、神經科學、腫瘤學和美學領域處於領先地位。艾伯維利用其專業知識、敬業的員工和獨特的創新方法來開發和銷售先進的療法，以解決世界上一些最複雜和最嚴重的疾病。艾伯維 (AbbVie) 於 2012 年 4 月 10 日在特拉華州註冊成立。 2013 年 1 月 1 日，雅培實驗室 (Abbott) 將其 100% 已發行普通股分配給雅培股東，成為一家獨立的上市公司。"},{"en":"AbbVie operates as a single global business segment dedicated to the research and development, manufacturing, commercialization and sale of innovative medicines and therapies. This operating structure enables the Chief Executive Officer, as Chief Operating Decision Maker (CODM), to allocate resources and assess business performance on a global basis in order to achieve established long-term strategic goals. Consistent with this structure, a global research and development and supply chain organization is responsible for the discovery, development, manufacturing and supply of products. Commercial efforts that coordinate the marketing, sales and distribution of these products are organized by geographic region or therapeutic area. All of these activities are supported by a global corporate administrative staff. The determination of a single business segment is consistent with the consolida","zh":"艾伯維作為一個單一的全球業務部門運營，致力於創新藥物和療法的研發、製造、商業化和銷售。這種營運結構使執行長作為首席營運決策者 (CODM) 能夠在全球範圍內分配資源並評估業務績效，以實現既定的長期策略目標。與此結構一致，全球研發和供應鏈組織負責產品的發現、開發、製造和供應。協調這些產品的營銷、銷售和分銷的商業活動是按地理區域或治療領域組織的。所有這些活動均得到全球企業管理人員的支持。單一業務分部的認定與合併報表一致"},{"en":"Immunology products. AbbVie maintains an extensive immunology portfolio across rheumatology, dermatology and gastroenterology. AbbVie's immunology products address unmet needs for patients with autoimmune diseases. These products are:","zh":"免疫學產品。艾伯維（AbbVie）在風濕病學、皮膚病學和胃腸病學領域擁有廣泛的免疫學產品組合。艾伯維（AbbVie）的免疫學產品解決了自體免疫疾病患者未滿足的需求。這些產品是："}],"markets":[{"en":"AbbVie operates as a single global business segment dedicated to the research and development, manufacturing, commercialization and sale of innovative medicines and therapies. This operating structure enables the Chief Executive Officer, as Chief Operating Decision Maker (CODM), to allocate resources and assess business performance on a global basis in order to achieve established long-term strategic goals. Consistent with this structure, a global research and development and supply chain organization is responsible for the discovery, development, manufacturing and supply of products. Commercial efforts that coordinate the marketing, sales and distribution of these products are organized by geographic region or therapeutic area. All of these activities are supported by a global corporate administrative staff. The determination of a single business segment is consistent with the consolida","zh":"艾伯維作為一個單一的全球業務部門運營，致力於創新藥物和療法的研發、製造、商業化和銷售。這種營運結構使執行長作為首席營運決策者 (CODM) 能夠在全球範圍內分配資源並評估業務績效，以實現既定的長期策略目標。與此結構一致，全球研發和供應鏈組織負責產品的發現、開發、製造和供應。協調這些產品的營銷、銷售和分銷的商業活動是按地理區域或治療領域組織的。所有這些活動均得到全球企業管理人員的支持。單一業務分部的認定與合併報表一致"},{"en":"AbbVie's portfolio of products includes a broad line of therapies that address some of the world's most complex and serious diseases.","zh":"艾伯維（AbbVie）的產品組合包括廣泛的療法，可治療世界上一些最複雜和最嚴重的疾病。"}],"customers":[{"en":"In the United States, AbbVie distributes pharmaceutical products principally through independent wholesale distributors, with some sales directly to retailers, pharmacies, patients or other customers. In 2025, three wholesale distributors (McKesson Corporation, Cardinal Health, Inc. and Cencora, Inc.) accounted for substantially all of AbbVie's pharmaceutical product sales in the United States. No individual wholesaler accounted for greater than 43% of AbbVie's 2025 gross revenues in the United States. Outside the United States, AbbVie sells products primarily to wholesalers or through distributors, and depending on the market, works through largely centralized national payers systems to agree on reimbursement terms.","zh":"在美國，艾伯維主要透過獨立批發經銷商分銷藥品，部分直接銷售給零售商、藥局、病患或其他客戶。 2025 年，三家批發分銷商（McKesson Corporation、Cardinal Health, Inc. 和 Cencora, Inc.）幾乎佔據了艾伯維在美國的全部藥品銷售額。沒有一家個體批發商的收入佔艾伯維 2025 年美國總收入的 43% 以上。在美國以外，艾伯維主要向批發商或透過經銷商銷售產品，並根據市場情況，透過主要集中的國家支付系統來商定報銷條款。"}],"competition":[{"en":"The markets for AbbVie's products are highly competitive. AbbVie competes with other research-based pharmaceuticals and biotechnology companies that discover, manufacture, market and sell proprietary pharmaceutical products, therapies and biologics. For example, AbbVie's immunology products compete with IL-23 inhibitors, IL-17 inhibitors, JAK inhibitors, biosimilars and other competitive products intended to treat a number of disease states, and AbbVie's oncology products compete with targeted therapies including BTK inhibitors, ADCs, cell therapies and other competitive products intended to treat certain cancers. In addition, a number of other companies have successfully developed and market products that are being positioned as competitors to Botox. The search for technological innovations in pharmaceutical products is a significant aspect of competition. The introduction of new produc","zh":"艾伯維產品的市場競爭非常激烈。艾伯維與其他發現、製造、行銷和銷售專有藥品、療法和生物製劑的研究型製藥和生物技術公司競爭。例如，艾伯維的免疫學產品與IL-23抑制劑、IL-17抑制劑、JAK抑制劑、生物相似藥和其他旨在治療多種疾病狀態的競爭產品競爭，而艾伯維的腫瘤學產品與標靶治療產品競爭，包括BTK抑制劑、ADC、細胞療法和其他旨在治療某些癌症的競爭產品。此外，許多其他公司已成功開發和銷售被定位為肉毒桿菌競爭對手的產品。尋求藥品技術創新是競爭的一個重要面向。新產品引進"},{"en":"Biosimilars. Competition for AbbVie's biologic products is affected by the approval of follow-on biologics, also known as \"biosimilars.\" Biologics have added major therapeutic options for the treatment of many diseases, including some for which therapies were unavailable or inadequate. The cost of developing and producing biologic therapies is typically dramatically higher than for small molecule medications, and many biologic medications are used for ongoing treatment of chronic diseases, such as rheumatoid arthritis or inflammatory bowel disease, or for the treatment of previously untreatable cancer. Significant investments in biologics infrastructure and manufacturing are necessary to produce biologic products.","zh":"生物相似藥。艾伯維生物製品的競爭受到後續生物製品（也稱為「生物相似藥」）批准的影響。生物製劑為許多疾病的治療增加了主要的治療選擇，包括一些治療方法不可用或不充分的疾病。開發和生產生物療法的成本通常遠高於小分子藥物，許多生物藥物用於持續治療慢性疾病，例如類風濕性關節炎或發炎性腸道疾病，或用於治療以前無法治療的癌症。生產生物製品需要對生物製品基礎設施和製造進行大量投資。"}],"segments":{"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":46603000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Other Countries","val":5759000000,"zh":"其他國家"},{"name":"DE","val":1738000000,"zh":"德國"},{"name":"JP","val":1274000000,"zh":"日本"},{"name":"CA","val":1222000000,"zh":"加拿大"},{"name":"CN","val":1006000000,"zh":"中國"},{"name":"FR","val":806000000,"zh":"FR"},{"name":"GB","val":626000000,"zh":"英國"},{"name":"ES","val":609000000,"zh":"ES"},{"name":"IT","val":580000000,"zh":"它"}],"total":61160000000}},"peers":["ABT","BMY","JNJ","GILD","MRK"]}}